{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-definition-and-concepts","title":"原子操作的定义与核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-definition-and-concepts","wordCount":1395,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"原子操作的定义与核心概念\">原子操作的定义与核心概念</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>原子操作（Atomic Operation）</strong> 是指一个操作要么<strong>完整执行</strong>、要么<strong>完全不执行</strong>，不存在被其他线程观察到的中间状态。它是解决简单共享数据并发访问的一种<strong>无锁</strong>手段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>不可分割性</strong></td>\n<td>操作执行中不会被其他线程打断或观察到中间状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>全有或全无</strong></td>\n<td>效果对外界瞬间生效，没有&quot;执行了一半&quot;的可能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>线程安全</strong></td>\n<td>多线程同时执行原子操作时，每个操作都能正确完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  P[&quot;问题:竞态条件&lt;br/&gt;counter++ 被拆成读-改-写三步&quot;] --&gt; N[&quot;非原子操作:步骤间可被其他线程插入&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; A[&quot;原子操作:整体不可分割&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; A1[&quot;外部只能看到操作前或操作后的状态&quot;]&#10;  N --&gt; N1[&quot;丢失更新:两个线程各加 1,结果只增加 1&quot;]\">graph TD\n  P[\"问题:竞态条件&lt;br/&gt;counter++ 被拆成读-改-写三步\"] --&gt; N[\"非原子操作:步骤间可被其他线程插入\"]\n  P --&gt; A[\"原子操作:整体不可分割\"]\n  A --&gt; A1[\"外部只能看到操作前或操作后的状态\"]\n  N --&gt; N1[\"丢失更新:两个线程各加 1,结果只增加 1\"]</pre><p>原子操作与锁的目标相同——保证共享数据的一致性——但路径不同：锁通过&quot;互斥进入临界区&quot;实现，原子操作则把不可分割性下沉到硬件指令。因此它适用于<strong>单个变量或简单操作</strong>，而对于多变量、多步逻辑，仍需回到锁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题背景\">问题背景</h2><p>在多线程环境中，多个线程可能同时访问和修改同一份数据。如果一个操作在执行过程中被其他线程打断，就会产生<strong>不一致的中间状态</strong>，导致数据损坏或程序行为异常。这类问题统称为<strong>竞态条件（Race Condition）</strong>。</p>\n<p>考虑一个最简单的场景——两个线程同时对计数器执行加一操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 线程 A 和 线程 B 同时执行&#10;counter = counter + 1\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 线程 A 和 线程 B 同时执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>counter = counter + 1</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条看似简单的语句，在底层实际上分为三个步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"步骤 1: 读取 counter 的当前值到寄存器&#10;步骤 2: 将寄存器的值加 1&#10;步骤 3: 将结果写回 counter\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 1: 读取 counter 的当前值到寄存器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 2: 将寄存器的值加 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>步骤 3: 将结果写回 counter</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当两个线程交错执行这三个步骤时，就可能出现<strong>丢失更新</strong>的问题。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant M as Memory (counter)&#10;    participant A as Thread A&#10;    participant B as Thread B&#10;&#10;    Note over M: counter = 0&#10;&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;M: Read counter → 0&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;M: Read counter → 0&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;A: Compute 0 + 1 = 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 0 + 1 = 1&#10;    A-&gt;&gt;M: Write back counter = 1&#10;    B-&gt;&gt;M: Write back counter = 1&#10;&#10;    Note over M: counter = 1 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Expected value should be 2\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Memory (counter)\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n\n    Note over M: counter = 0\n\n    A-&gt;&gt;M: Read counter → 0\n    B-&gt;&gt;M: Read counter → 0\n    A-&gt;&gt;A: Compute 0 + 1 = 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;B: Compute 0 + 1 = 1\n    A-&gt;&gt;M: Write back counter = 1\n    B-&gt;&gt;M: Write back counter = 1\n\n    Note over M: counter = 1 ❌&lt;br/&gt;Expected value should be 2</pre><blockquote>\n<p>两个线程各执行了一次加一操作，但最终结果只增加了 1。这就是竞态条件最经典的表现形式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心原理\">核心原理</h2><h3 id=\"什么是原子操作\">什么是原子操作</h3><p><strong>原子操作（Atomic Operation）</strong> 是指一个操作要么<strong>完整执行</strong>，要么<strong>完全不执行</strong>，不存在被其他线程观察到的中间状态。&quot;原子&quot;一词借用了物理学中的概念——不可再分的最小单位。</p>\n<p>在并发编程中，原子操作具备以下关键特性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">特性</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>不可分割性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">操作在执行过程中不会被任何其他线程打断或观察到中间状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>全有或全无</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">操作的效果对外界来说是瞬间生效的，没有&quot;执行了一半&quot;的可能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>线程安全</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">多个线程同时执行原子操作时，每个操作都能正确完成，不会产生数据竞争</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph Non-Atomic Operation&#10;        direction TB&#10;        N1[&quot;Read value&quot;] --&gt; N2[&quot;Modify value&quot;] --&gt; N3[&quot;Write back value&quot;]&#10;        N4[&quot;⚠️ Other threads&lt;br/&gt;can intervene between any steps&quot;]&#10;        N2 -.-&gt; N4&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph Atomic Operation&#10;        direction TB&#10;        A1[&quot;Read → Modify → Write back&lt;br/&gt;Executed as one indivisible unit&quot;]&#10;        A2[&quot;✅ Other threads&lt;br/&gt;cannot observe intermediate state&quot;]&#10;        A1 -.-&gt; A2&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph Non-Atomic Operation\n        direction TB\n        N1[\"Read value\"] --&gt; N2[\"Modify value\"] --&gt; N3[\"Write back value\"]\n        N4[\"⚠️ Other threads&lt;br/&gt;can intervene between any steps\"]\n        N2 -.-&gt; N4\n    end\n\n    subgraph Atomic Operation\n        direction TB\n        A1[\"Read → Modify → Write back&lt;br/&gt;Executed as one indivisible unit\"]\n        A2[\"✅ Other threads&lt;br/&gt;cannot observe intermediate state\"]\n        A1 -.-&gt; A2\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"原子操作的目的\">原子操作的目的</h3><p>原子操作存在的核心目的可以归纳为两点：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>避免竞态条件</strong>：确保对共享数据的操作不会因线程交错而产生错误结果</li>\n<li><strong>保证数据一致性</strong>：任何时刻，其他线程观察到的数据都是某次操作完成后的完整状态</li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"分类与变体\">分类与变体</h2><h3 id=\"原子变量\">原子变量</h3><p><strong>原子变量（Atomic Variable）</strong> 是对普通变量的封装，使得对该变量的所有操作（读取、写入、修改）都具备原子性。它是原子操作最常见的载体。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// 普通变量 —— 非线程安全&#10;普通变量 counter = 0&#10;&#10;// 原子变量 —— 线程安全&#10;原子变量 atomicCounter = 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 普通变量 —— 非线程安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>普通变量 counter = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 原子变量 —— 线程安全</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>原子变量 atomicCounter = 0</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原子变量通常支持以下操作：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">说明</th>\n<th align=\"left\">示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>原子读取</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">读取变量的当前值，保证读到完整的值</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>value = atomicCounter.load()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>原子写入</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">将新值写入变量，保证写入是完整的</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>atomicCounter.store(42)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>原子加减</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">对变量进行加减运算，读-改-写一步完成</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>atomicCounter.fetchAdd(1)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>比较并交换</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">只在当前值等于期望值时才更新</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>atomicCounter.compareAndSwap(old, new)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>原子交换</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">设置新值并返回旧值，一步完成</td>\n<td align=\"left\"><code>old = atomicCounter.exchange(new)</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"原子操作-vs-非原子操作\">原子操作 vs 非原子操作</h3><p>下面通过一个具体场景对比原子操作与非原子操作的行为差异：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 场景：两个线程各自对 counter 执行 1000 次加一&#10;&#10;// ---- 非原子操作 ----&#10;let counter = 0;&#10;&#10;function incrementNonAtomic(): void {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;    counter = counter + 1; // 读-改-写，可被打断&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;// 两个线程并发执行后，counter 的值不确定&#10;// 可能是 1000 ~ 2000 之间的任意值&#10;&#10;// ---- 原子操作 ----&#10;let atomicCounter = createAtomicInteger(0);&#10;&#10;function incrementAtomic(): void {&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; 1000; i++) {&#10;    atomicCounter.fetchAdd(1); // 读-改-写，不可分割&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;// 两个线程并发执行后，atomicCounter 的值一定是 2000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 场景：两个线程各自对 counter 执行 1000 次加一</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ---- 非原子操作 ----</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> incrementNonAtomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> counter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读-改-写，可被打断</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 两个线程并发执行后，counter 的值不确定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 可能是 1000 ~ 2000 之间的任意值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ---- 原子操作 ----</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> atomicCounter </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> createAtomicInteger</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> incrementAtomic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    atomicCounter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">fetchAdd</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 读-改-写，不可分割</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 两个线程并发执行后，atomicCounter 的值一定是 2000</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作流程\">工作流程</h2><p>原子操作在底层的执行流程与普通操作有本质区别。以&quot;原子加一&quot;为例：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    START[&quot;Thread requests atomicCounter + 1&quot;]&#10;    LOCK[&quot;CPU locks memory bus / cache line&quot;]&#10;    READ[&quot;Read current value of counter&quot;]&#10;    MODIFY[&quot;Increment value by 1&quot;]&#10;    WRITE[&quot;Write new value back to memory&quot;]&#10;    UNLOCK[&quot;Release memory bus / cache line lock&quot;]&#10;    DONE[&quot;Operation complete, other threads can access&quot;]&#10;&#10;    START --&gt; LOCK --&gt; READ --&gt; MODIFY --&gt; WRITE --&gt; UNLOCK --&gt; DONE&#10;&#10;    OTHER[&quot;Access requests from other threads&quot;]&#10;    WAIT[&quot;Wait (blocked)&quot;]&#10;    OTHER --&gt; WAIT&#10;    WAIT -.-&gt;|&quot;After lock is released&quot;| DONE\">flowchart TD\n    START[\"Thread requests atomicCounter + 1\"]\n    LOCK[\"CPU locks memory bus / cache line\"]\n    READ[\"Read current value of counter\"]\n    MODIFY[\"Increment value by 1\"]\n    WRITE[\"Write new value back to memory\"]\n    UNLOCK[\"Release memory bus / cache line lock\"]\n    DONE[\"Operation complete, other threads can access\"]\n\n    START --&gt; LOCK --&gt; READ --&gt; MODIFY --&gt; WRITE --&gt; UNLOCK --&gt; DONE\n\n    OTHER[\"Access requests from other threads\"]\n    WAIT[\"Wait (blocked)\"]\n    OTHER --&gt; WAIT\n    WAIT -.-&gt;|\"After lock is released\"| DONE</pre><blockquote>\n<p>在锁定期间，整个&quot;读取-修改-写回&quot;过程对外界表现为一个不可分割的瞬间操作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>下面用时间线对比原子操作和非原子操作在两个线程并发执行时的行为：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant M as Memory (counter)&#10;    participant A as Thread A&#10;    participant B as Thread B&#10;&#10;    Note over M: counter = 5&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)&#10;        Note over A,M: Atomic operation: Thread A executes completely&#10;        A-&gt;&gt;M: Atomic fetchAdd(1)&lt;br/&gt;Read 5 → Add 1 → Write back 6&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Note over M: counter = 6&#10;&#10;    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)&#10;        Note over B,M: Atomic operation: Thread B executes completely&#10;        B-&gt;&gt;M: Atomic fetchAdd(1)&lt;br/&gt;Read 6 → Add 1 → Write back 7&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    Note over M: counter = 7 ✅\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant M as Memory (counter)\n    participant A as Thread A\n    participant B as Thread B\n\n    Note over M: counter = 5\n\n    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)\n        Note over A,M: Atomic operation: Thread A executes completely\n        A-&gt;&gt;M: Atomic fetchAdd(1)&lt;br/&gt;Read 5 → Add 1 → Write back 6\n    end\n\n    Note over M: counter = 6\n\n    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)\n        Note over B,M: Atomic operation: Thread B executes completely\n        B-&gt;&gt;M: Atomic fetchAdd(1)&lt;br/&gt;Read 6 → Add 1 → Write back 7\n    end\n\n    Note over M: counter = 7 ✅</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"优劣对比\">优劣对比</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\">维度</th>\n<th align=\"left\">原子操作</th>\n<th align=\"left\">非原子操作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>线程安全</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">✅ 天然线程安全</td>\n<td align=\"left\">❌ 需要额外同步机制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>性能</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">比锁轻量，但比普通操作略慢</td>\n<td align=\"left\">最快，无额外开销</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>适用场景</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">简单的计数器、标志位、状态变量</td>\n<td align=\"left\">单线程环境或已有锁保护</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>复杂度</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">只能保护单个变量的单次操作</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>硬件依赖</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">需要 CPU 指令集支持</td>\n<td align=\"left\">无硬件要求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\"><strong>可组合性</strong></td>\n<td align=\"left\">❌ 多个原子操作的组合不是原子的</td>\n<td align=\"left\">不适用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>关键限制</strong>：两个独立的原子操作组合在一起<strong>不具有原子性</strong>。例如&quot;先读取 A 再读取 B&quot;不能保证 A 和 B 的值来自同一时刻。如果需要保护多个变量或多步操作，仍然需要使用锁。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"pseudocode\" data-code=\"// ⚠️ 非原子的组合&#10;value1 = atomicA.load()     // 原子读取 A&#10;value2 = atomicB.load()     // 原子读取 B&#10;// 在这两次读取之间，其他线程可能已经修改了 A 或 B&#10;// value1 和 value2 可能不一致&#10;&#10;// ✅ 如果需要同时读取 A 和 B 的一致快照，需要使用锁&#10;lock.acquire()&#10;value1 = A&#10;value2 = B&#10;lock.release()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// ⚠️ 非原子的组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value1 = atomicA.load()     // 原子读取 A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value2 = atomicB.load()     // 原子读取 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 在这两次读取之间，其他线程可能已经修改了 A 或 B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// value1 和 value2 可能不一致</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ✅ 如果需要同时读取 A 和 B 的一致快照，需要使用锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock.acquire()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value1 = A</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>value2 = B</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>lock.release()</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    CORE[&quot;Atomic Operations&quot;]&#10;    DEF[&quot;Definition: Indivisible operation&lt;br/&gt;Either fully executes or not at all&quot;]&#10;    PURPOSE[&quot;Purpose&quot;]&#10;    P1[&quot;Avoid race conditions&quot;]&#10;    P2[&quot;Guarantee data consistency&quot;]&#10;    TYPES[&quot;Common Operations&quot;]&#10;    T1[&quot;Atomic read/write&quot;]&#10;    T2[&quot;Atomic add/subtract&quot;]&#10;    T3[&quot;Compare-and-Swap (CAS)&quot;]&#10;    T4[&quot;Atomic exchange&quot;]&#10;    LIMIT[&quot;Limitations&quot;]&#10;    L1[&quot;Can only protect single-variable single-operation&quot;]&#10;    L2[&quot;Compound operations are not atomic&quot;]&#10;&#10;    CORE --&gt; DEF&#10;    CORE --&gt; PURPOSE&#10;    PURPOSE --&gt; P1&#10;    PURPOSE --&gt; P2&#10;    CORE --&gt; TYPES&#10;    TYPES --&gt; T1&#10;    TYPES --&gt; T2&#10;    TYPES --&gt; T3&#10;    TYPES --&gt; T4&#10;    CORE --&gt; LIMIT&#10;    LIMIT --&gt; L1&#10;    LIMIT --&gt; L2\">flowchart TD\n    CORE[\"Atomic Operations\"]\n    DEF[\"Definition: Indivisible operation&lt;br/&gt;Either fully executes or not at all\"]\n    PURPOSE[\"Purpose\"]\n    P1[\"Avoid race conditions\"]\n    P2[\"Guarantee data consistency\"]\n    TYPES[\"Common Operations\"]\n    T1[\"Atomic read/write\"]\n    T2[\"Atomic add/subtract\"]\n    T3[\"Compare-and-Swap (CAS)\"]\n    T4[\"Atomic exchange\"]\n    LIMIT[\"Limitations\"]\n    L1[\"Can only protect single-variable single-operation\"]\n    L2[\"Compound operations are not atomic\"]\n\n    CORE --&gt; DEF\n    CORE --&gt; PURPOSE\n    PURPOSE --&gt; P1\n    PURPOSE --&gt; P2\n    CORE --&gt; TYPES\n    TYPES --&gt; T1\n    TYPES --&gt; T2\n    TYPES --&gt; T3\n    TYPES --&gt; T4\n    CORE --&gt; LIMIT\n    LIMIT --&gt; L1\n    LIMIT --&gt; L2</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>原子操作</strong>是并发编程中保证数据安全的基础机制，其核心特性是<strong>不可分割性</strong></li>\n<li>它通过硬件指令支持，将&quot;读取-修改-写回&quot;等多步操作合并为一个不可被打断的整体</li>\n<li><strong>原子变量</strong>是原子操作的常见载体，支持原子读写、加减、比较并交换等操作</li>\n<li>原子操作比锁更轻量，但<strong>只适用于单变量的简单操作</strong></li>\n<li>多个原子操作的组合<strong>不具有原子性</strong>，复杂的同步需求仍需使用锁机制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"原子操作的定义与核心概念","id":"原子操作的定义与核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"问题背景","id":"问题背景"},{"level":2,"text":"核心原理","id":"核心原理"},{"level":3,"text":"什么是原子操作","id":"什么是原子操作"},{"level":3,"text":"原子操作的目的","id":"原子操作的目的"},{"level":2,"text":"分类与变体","id":"分类与变体"},{"level":3,"text":"原子变量","id":"原子变量"},{"level":3,"text":"原子操作 vs 非原子操作","id":"原子操作-vs-非原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"工作流程","id":"工作流程"},{"level":2,"text":"优劣对比","id":"优劣对比"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"并发与并行的实现机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/concurrency-and-parallelism/concurrency-parallelism-implementation"},"next":{"title":"原子操作的核心思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/threads-concurrency/atomic-operations/atomic-core-ideas"}}